\par }{\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid219677 
\par }{\f0\insrsid4403853\charrsid4403853 Manipulators are operators used in C++ for formatting output. The data is manipulated by the programmer\rquote s choice of displaye}{\f0\insrsid4403853 d endl manipulator.}{\f0\insrsid4403853\charrsid4403853 
 This manipulator has the same functionality as the \lquote \\n\rquote  newline character.}{\b\f0\cf0\ulc0\insrsid4403853\charrsid4403853 
