\b\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670  }{\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 What will be the output of following functions if we call these functions three times?
\par 
\par }{\b\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 1)
\par }{\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 void func1()\{
\par int x = 0;
\par x++;
\par cout << x << endl;
\par \}}{\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604 
\par }{\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid1795721 
\par }{\b\f39\cf17\ulc0\insrsid1795721\charrsid1795721 Output will be:
