\par }\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\tx6525\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 In main function of the program
\par \tab 
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f39\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 \hich\af39\dbch\af0\loch\f39 5.\tab}}\pard \ql \fi-360\li720\ri0\widctlpar\tx720\tx6525\faauto\ls3\rin0\lin720\itap0 {\f39\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 
Prompt the user to enter the number of objects to be created.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f39\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 \hich\af39\dbch\af0\loch\f39 6.\tab}Dynamically allocate memory to objects according to the size entered by user.
\par {\listtext\pard\plain\f39\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 \hich\af39\dbch\af0\loch\f39 7.\tab}De-allocate memory that was allocated to objects }{\f39\ul\cf0\ulc0\insrsid15336604\charrsid12259670 
